<title>FINLAND: FINNISH JAN GDP RISES 5.7 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>FINNISH JAN GDP RISES 5.7 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's gross domestic</p>
<p>product (GDP) rose 5.7 percent year-on-year in January,</p>
<p>Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Adjusted for seasonal factors, GDP rose 0.4 percent in</p>
<p>January on December, SF said.</p>
<p>			  Jan 1997	Dec 1996	Jan 1996</p>
<p> Yr/yr		  +5.7 pct	+6.2 pct	+1.7 pct</p>
<p> Mth/mth		+0.4 pct	+0.4 pct	+0.4 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
